{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pint Sized is a co-operative drink-serving simulation platformer revolving around the jobs of Coco and Hazel: two squirrels down on their luck working to pay rent on their tree. They must work together to effectively fulfill customers orders, splitting the tasks of grabbing glasses, pouring pints, and swiftly serving between both players.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the demo, you can play through all three levels of the first world, the Greyfur Pub, where you can learn the basics of the game. From time management and multi-tasking to mixing drinks and throwing them to your partner, aim to get a higher score with every run of a level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017240/extras/67cdc2da17210746f50b82f45485944f.poster.avif?t=1761042806\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017240/extras/67cdc2da17210746f50b82f45485944f.webm?t=1761042806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017240/extras/67cdc2da17210746f50b82f45485944f.mp4?t=1761042806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Coco and Hazel to serve drinks in a variety of levels, each with their own challenges to discover and overcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017240/extras/5d9a9e4e9b0a1d5810696e5cbeb0fbd2.poster.avif?t=1761042806\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017240/extras/5d9a9e4e9b0a1d5810696e5cbeb0fbd2.webm?t=1761042806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017240/extras/5d9a9e4e9b0a1d5810696e5cbeb0fbd2.mp4?t=1761042806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab two drinks and mix them into one tasty pint to earn more nuts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017240/extras/4ac75792a5a0abdd54adb99ef10319a9.poster.avif?t=1761042806\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017240/extras/4ac75792a5a0abdd54adb99ef10319a9.webm?t=1761042806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017240/extras/4ac75792a5a0abdd54adb99ef10319a9.mp4?t=1761042806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Get creative to overcome obstacles and keep the drinks flowing.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4017240?t=1761042806","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4017240?t=1761042806","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017240/03a722d94f863a7ea5754a294f7108e925405680/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761042806","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017240/03a722d94f863a7ea5754a294f7108e925405680/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761042806","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Game 